{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r3--gemma31","runHash":"02b07430","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r3--gemma31.e00ae762.mp3","audioBytes":249816,"durationMs":83142,"runEndMs":50249,"timeMap":[[0,0],[22456,22456],[23156,22456],[34345,33645],[40408,33645],[46654,35428],[47004,35728],[47704,35728],[51787,39811],[52487,39811],[62925,50249],[83142,50249]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6941,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. 4 Gemma 4 31B agents on the field today, with a shared cache on the side."},{"audioMs":7291,"endMs":10375,"runMs":7291,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10725,"endMs":15187,"runMs":10725,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15537,"endMs":17979,"runMs":15537,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi_b","text":"I want to see if the cache keeps pulling them back."},{"audioMs":23156,"endMs":26352,"runMs":22456,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 1 opens the cache."},{"audioMs":35045,"endMs":38535,"runMs":33645,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"2 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":38885,"endMs":40058,"runMs":33645,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":40408,"endMs":46654,"runMs":33645,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolveN","text":"First solves of the run, and more than one at once. From here, every board visit is a choice."},{"audioMs":47704,"endMs":51390,"runMs":35728,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 2 solves the task, in 26 steps."},{"audioMs":52487,"endMs":56323,"runMs":39811,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 3 gets there in 28 steps."},{"audioMs":62925,"endMs":71100,"runMs":50249,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 3 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":71450,"endMs":78252,"runMs":50249,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":78602,"endMs":79635,"runMs":50249,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":79985,"endMs":80942,"runMs":50249,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":4,"segment":2,"solve":4},"dropped":21}}
